# Gatepoint Phase 1 — Implementation Plan

## Overview

**Gatepoint** is a cloud-based Event Registration Platform built as a multi-tenant SaaS product. Phase 1 delivers a production-ready MVP with authentication, organization management, event creation, public landing pages, registration forms, attendee management, QR code generation, and email delivery.

This plan covers the full architecture and all 17 implementation steps. We will execute them **one at a time**, waiting for your approval between each step.

