### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|:---|:---|
| `organization_id` on every tenant table | Enables RLS tenant isolation without joins |
| `slug` on organizations and events | Human-readable URLs (`/events/tech-conf-2026`) |
| `jsonb settings` columns | Extensible without schema changes for future config |
| `jsonb landing_page_config` | Stores landing page layout/content as structured JSON |
| `confirmation_number` on registrations | Public-facing identifier (not UUID) |
| Separate `form_fields` table | Dynamic form builder support |
| `registration_responses` linking to `form_fields` | EAV pattern for dynamic form answers |
| `checked_in_at` on registrations | Future QR check-in without schema change |

