## Security Architecture

### Defense Layers

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Client Request"] --> B["Next.js Middleware"]
    B --> C["Auth Check (JWT)"]
    C --> D["Server Action / API Route"]
    D --> E["Service Layer (Authorization)"]
    E --> F["Supabase Client (with user JWT)"]
    F --> G["PostgreSQL + RLS Policies"]
    G --> H["Data Response"]

    style G fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style E fill:#ea580c,color:#fff
    style C fill:#ca8a04,color:#fff
```

### RLS Policy Summary

| Table | SELECT | INSERT | UPDATE | DELETE |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `profiles` | Own profile | Own profile | Own profile | ❌ |
| `organizations` | Members only | Authenticated | Owner/Admin | Owner only |
| `organization_members` | Same org members | Owner/Admin | Owner/Admin | Owner/Admin |
| `events` | Org members (+ public if published) | Organizer+ | Organizer+ | Admin+ |
| `registration_forms` | Org members (+ public if active) | Organizer+ | Organizer+ | Admin+ |
| `form_fields` | Via form access | Organizer+ | Organizer+ | Organizer+ |
| `registrations` | Org members | Public (register) | Org members | Admin+ |
| `registration_responses` | Via registration access | With registration | ❌ | Admin+ |
| `qr_codes` | Org members | System only | System only | Admin+ |

